{"type":"message","id":"5407e29f","parentId":"eab38bfb","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:42:17.247Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to transcribe the handwritten payroll record into an electronic spreadsheet. But I can't analyze the image directly because all image models are unavailable. Let me think about alternatives...\n\nI could use the Agent Browser skill to try to process the image through some online tool, but that seems overly complicated and unlikely to work well.\n\nActually, let me try a different approach - I can try to read the image file directly to see if there's any EXIF data or OCR text embedded, or I can try encoding the image and using a different method.\n\nWait, the `read` tool says it supports images (jpg, png, gif, webp) and sends them as attachments. But that's for the user to see. Let me try the `image` tool with a different model or see if there's another way.\n\nActually, let me try the read tool on the image to see what happens - it says \"Supports text files and images (jpg, png, gif, webp). Images are sent as attachments.\" So it doesn't OCR the image, it just sends it as an attachment.\n\nLet me think of another approach. I could:\n1. Try to use web_search to find an OCR tool/API\n2. Try using the agent browser skill to upload the image to an OCR service\n3. Try installing an OCR tool like tesseract locally\n\nLet me try option 3 - installing tesseract and running OCR on the image.\n\nActually, let me try a few things in parallel:\n1. Check if tesseract is available or can be installed\n2. Also try to see if there's any way to use a different image model\n\nLet me start by checking for tesseract and trying to install it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c2c1dd8d16524152888e30ac","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which tesseract 2>/dev/null || (apt-get update -qq && apt-get install -y -qq tesseract-ocr tesseract-ocr-chi-sim tesseract-ocr-chi-tra 2>&1 | tail -5)","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779108092341,"responseId":"1a4676d37e5f4e0fb2e1cc517abeb87c"}}
