{"type":"message","id":"44085fec","parentId":"ed8eb197","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:42:37.872Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Can't install packages due to permissions. Let me try another approach - maybe I can use Python with an OCR library, or use a web-based OCR service.\n\nLet me check if Python has any OCR capabilities available, or if I can use a different approach.\n\nActually, let me try to see if there's PIP available and if I can install pytesseract or similar.\n\nAlternatively, I could try to use the Agent Browser skill to upload the image to a free online OCR service and get the text that way. Let me check the Agent Browser skill first.\n\nActually, let me try a simpler approach first - check what's available.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_17dafbc510eb4115a65480e9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"import pytesseract\" 2>&1 || pip install pytesseract 2>&1 | tail -3","timeout":30}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_72377c792b27426abb2b6aa7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/agent-browser/SKILL.md","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779108137379,"responseId":"4493c32e62ef46489509e881b003b375"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7af01b24","parentId":"44085fec","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:42:37.993Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_17dafbc510eb4115a65480e9","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<string>\", line 1, in <module>\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'pytesseract'\n/usr/bin/sh: 1: pip: not found"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":112,"aggregated":"Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<string>\", line 1, in <module>\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'pytesseract'\n/usr/bin/sh: 1: pip: not found","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-wxlee"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779108157993}}
{"type":"message","id":"14ff1271","parentId":"7af01b24","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:42:37.993Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_72377c792b27426abb2b6aa7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: Agent Browser\ndescription: A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\nread_when:\n  - Automating web interactions\n  - Extracting structured data from pages\n  - Filling forms programmatically\n  - Testing web UIs\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🌐\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"node\",\"npm\"]}}}\nallowed-tools: Bash(agent-browser:*)\n---\n\n# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Installation\n\n### npm recommended\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g agent-browser\nagent-browser install\nagent-browser install --with-deps\n```\n\n### From Source\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser\ncd agent-browser\npnpm install\npnpm build\nagent-browser install\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n4. Re-snapshot after navigation or significant DOM changes\n\n[279 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779108157993}}
{"type":"message","id":"42d7bdc9","parentId":"14ff1271","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:43:16.724Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, I can't install tesseract or pytesseract due to permissions. Let me try a different approach. I'll use the Agent Browser to go to an online OCR service, upload the image, and extract the text.\n\nActually, that's quite complex and might not work well with a handwritten Chinese document.\n\nLet me try another approach - I can try to use Node.js with some built-in capabilities, or I could try using the web_fetch tool to access an OCR API.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The user said the image shows a payroll record with 17 employees. The description says:\n- Name, ID, bank card, salary, contact information\n- Total: 135,000 yuan\n\nSince I can't OCR the image directly, let me try using `agent-browser` to access an online OCR service. Let me check if agent-browser is installed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_326437fd077044f5bb651a7d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which agent-browser 2>/dev/null && agent-browser --version 2>/dev/null","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779108157994,"responseId":"432c73aef34146a49c3f5c80fad6a69e"}}
