{"type":"message","id":"24eab42d","parentId":"fff3e722","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:48:35.039Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The OCR API returned some results, but the text is quite garbled and doesn't capture the full payroll data properly. The result shows:\n- Title: 工资发放表 (Payroll/Payroll Distribution Table)\n- Headers: 姓名, 身份证号, 卡号, 应发工资, 实发工资, 联系电话, 签字\n- But the data rows are mostly garbled\n\nLet me try a different approach - I'll try the OCR API again with better parameters, or try a different OCR service.\n\nActually, let me try using a better OCR service or parameters. The current result is quite poor quality.\n\nLet me try:\n1. Using a different OCR service\n2. Or trying again with different parameters\n\nActually, let me try the Google Cloud Vision API... but that needs auth.\n\nLet me try a different free OCR service. I know there's a Chinese OCR service called \"PaddleOCR\" but that requires local installation.\n\nLet me try using the ocr.space API again but with different parameters, or try a different service.\n\nActually, let me try using the `web_search` to find a better Chinese OCR API, then use that.\n\nWait, let me try a different approach. I can try using the `agent-browser` skill if I can install it, or I can try to use a JavaScript-based OCR library.\n\nActually, let me try using Tesseract.js via Node.js - I can install it with npm and run it locally.\n\nLet me try that.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"OCR结果不太理想，文字识别质量较差。让我换个方式——用 Tesseract.js 在本地运行，效果应该更好。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9d39500e37be4c76bf1d7352","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"npm install -g tesseract.js 2>&1 | tail -5","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":19335,"output":367,"cacheRead":42,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19744,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779