{"type":"message","id":"bc87d1e2","parentId":"d1091961","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:08:55.045Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is much better! The OCR.space API with OCREngine=2 and the original image gave much better results. Let me clean this up and create the electronic spreadsheet. Let me analyze what I got:\n\nThe table has these columns: 序号, 姓名, 身份证号, 卡号, 开户行, 应发工资(元), 实发工资, 联系电话, 签字\n\nLet me reconstruct the data:\n\nRow 1: 姓名=胡条? (胡某?), 身份证号=5108214g505165318... hmm, this is garbled. Let me look more carefully.\n\nActually, looking at the OCR output, the structure is:\n\n1. 胡条 (or similar) - 5108214g505165318 - 621226230902b750822 - 2\n2. 张小之 (or 张小之?) - 50824197603056531 - _243之之鼓楼支行了. - 6215683/00026750240 - 中国银行之元分行\n3. 彭海冰 - 5108249888046265 - 62284823696/006||74 - 终行当溪加竣支行\n4. 刘国波 - 610726200305165415 - 621700440026962458 - 建行乐都支行\n5. 王开生 - b123261987014546 (should be 5123261987014546?) - 621700413003396226 - 汉中市西孙路支行\n6. 办万文迷 (应该是...?) - 2123761994-103054l0 (512376...) - b222.03290200464891 - 银及油城支行 (中国银行油城支行?)\n7. 李成洪 - 5682|a03235015 (510821...?)\n8. 刘加俊 - 510821197171050以1 - 62354926007034047 - 青海银行互助支行\n9. 唐仕之进 (唐仕之?) - 5082.104511025a55 - 6235992600696553\n10. 薑朝李 (姜朝李?) - 5n82/20007/050lb - 6235992b007034||2\n11. 房泽 - 5b82194308035012 - 6235992600734l4\n12. 唐蓉 - 50824850218 5029 - 6235992b0070340b2\n13. 刘顺 - 56821977n1055037 - 62359426087034095\n14. 唐俊 - 50829980g135olL - 6235992603734070\n15. 革朝案 (?) - 510821108707275336 - 6235992607034054 - 青海银行正助支行\n16-17: (empty rows?)\n\nAnd then the salaries:\n应发工资(元):\n1: 10000\n2: 5000\n3: 5000\n4: 10000\n5: 5000\n6: 10000\n7: 10000 (or 10000?)\n8: 10000\n9: 10000 (or 10000?)\n10: 10000\n11: 10000\n12: 0000 (or 10000?)\n13: 15000\n\nHmm, the OCR output is still quite garbled with the Chinese characters. Let me try to clean this up as best as I can, but I need to be honest that many characters are likely misrecognized.\n\nWait, let me look at the OCR text more carefully. Let me extract line by line:\n\n```\n工资发放表\n姓名\n身份证号\n卡炒 -> 卡号\n菸产行 -> 开户行\n\n胡条 -> ?\n5108214g505165318 -> 510821...\n621226230902b750822\n2 (序号?)\n\n张小之50824197603056531 -> 张小之? 510824...\n_243之之鼓楼支行了. -> 某银行某支行\n6215683/00026750240\n中国银行之元分行 -> 中国银行某分行\n\n3 彭海冰5108249888046265 -> 彭海冰 510824...\n62284823696/006||74 -> 622848...\n终行当溪加竣支行 -> 中国银行某支行?\n\n4 刘国波610726200305165415. -> 刘国波 610726...\n621700440026962458.\n建行乐都支行\n\n5 五开生 -> 王开生?\nb123261987014546 -> 512326...\n621700413003396226\n汉中市西孙路支行 -> 汉中市西环路支行?\n\n6 办万文迷 -> 可能为杨万文?\n2123761994-103054l0 -> 512376...\nb222.03290200464891 -> 6222...\n银及油城支行 -> 中国银行油城支行\n\n7 李成洪 5682|a03235015\n\n8 刘加俊510821197171050以1 -> 刘加俊 510821...\n62354926007034047_青海银行互助支行 -> 623549...\n62359426001034120 -> 两个卡号?\n\n9 唐仕之进5082.104511025a55 -> 唐仕之? 510821...\n6235992600696553\n\n10 薑朝李 -> 姜朝李?\n5n82/20007/050lb -> 510821...\n6235992b007034||2 -> 623599...\n\n11 房泽\n5b82194308035012 -> 510821...\n6235992600734l4 -> 623599...\n\n12 唐蓉\n50824850218 5029 -> 510824...\n6235992b0070340b2 -> 623599...\n\n13 刘顺\n56821977n1055037 -> 510821...\n62359426087034095 -> 623594...\n\n14 唐俊\n50829980g135olL -> 510821...\n6235992603734070 -> 623599...\n\n15 革朝案 -> 可能是 祁朝宗? 祁朝英?\n510821108707275336 -> 510821...\n6235992607034054\n青海银行正助支行 -> 青海银行互助支行\n\nSalaries:\n应发工资（元）\n10000z/ -> 10000\n5000%」-> 5000\n5000元） -> 5000\n10000元。-> 10000\n5000之4 -> 5000\n10000\n1anoo之 -> 10000\n100002 -> 10000\n10000之1 -> 10000\n1oc00z -> 10000\nJan0o礼 -> 10000\n10000\n0000 -> probably 10000\n15000之 -> 15000\n\nTotal should be 135,000. Let me sum:\n10000+5000+5000+10000+5000+10000+10000+10000+10000+10000+10000+10000+10000+15000 = 135,000 (if I count 14 entries with the 12th being 10000 not 0000)\n\nWait, the total is 135,000. Let me see how many entries:\nI see about 14-15 rows of data.\n10000*10 = 100,000 + 5000*4 = 20,000 + 15000 = 135,000\n\nSo there are:\n- 10 people with 10000\n- 4 people with 5000\n- 1 person with 15000\nTotal: 10 + 4 + 1 = 15 people... but the description said 17 people.\n\nHmm, but the total is 135,000. Let me try: 9*10000 + 4*5000 + 1*15000 = 90000+20000+15000 = 125,000. That doesn't work.\n\n8*10000 + 5*5000 + 1*15000 = 80000+25000+15000 = 120,000. Doesn't work.\n\nLet me just look at what the OCR gave me for salaries more carefully:\n1. 10000z/ -> 10000\n2. 5000%」 -> 5000\n3. 5000元） -> 5000\n4. 10000元。-> 10000\n5. 5000之4 -> 5000\n6. 10000\n7. 1anoo之 -> 10000\n8. 100002 -> 10000\n9. 10000之1 -> 10000\n10. 1oc00z -> 10000\n11. Jan0o礼 -> 10000\n12. 10000\n13. 0000 -> probably 10000\n14. 15000之 -> 15000\n\nIf #12 is 10000 (not 0000) and #13 is 10000:\n10000*11 + 5000*3 + 15000 = 110000+15000+15000 = 140,000. Too high.\n\nIf #13 is 5000:\n10000*11 + 5000*4 + 15000 = 110000+20000+15000 = 145,000. Too high.\n\nIf #12 is 0000 (actually 0):\n10000*10 + 5000*3 + 0 + 15000 = 100000+15000+15000 = 130,000. Doesn't match.\n\nHmm, 15000*1 + 10000*11 + 5000*2 = 15000+110000+10000 = 135,000. Yes!\n\nSo: 1 person at 15000, 11 people at 10000, 2 people at 5000. But that's only 14 entries. The description says 17 people.\n\nActually wait, maybe I'm missing some rows. Let me re-read the output.\n\nActually this is getting complex with the garbled OCR. Let me just create the best possible version and present it to the user, noting that some characters may be misrecognized and ask them to verify.\n\nActually, let me try one more time with the OCR, using a different approach. Maybe I can extract the image portions separately.\n\nOr better yet, let me just proceed with what I have and create a clean CSV file. The user can then verify and correct.\n\nLet me try another approach - let me try the OCR again but with a prompt to get more structured output.\n\nActually, I think I should just produce the best result I can at this point and present it to the user. Many names and numbers will have OCR errors, but the core structure is there.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好多了！这次识别效果提升不少。让我把数据整理出来"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e7c255e684744a54bea4eceb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try Google Vision API via free alternative\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://api.ocr.space/parse/image\" \\\n  -H \"apikey:helloworld\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/7fd872e9-64a1-483e-833f-4b4326eae96e.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"language=chs\" \\\n  -F \"OCREngine=2\" \\\n  -F \"scale=true\" \\\n  -F \"isTable=true\" 2>&1 | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\ndata = json.load(sys.stdin)\nif data.get('ParsedResults'):\n  text = data['ParsedResults'][0].get('ParsedText', '')\n  lines = text.split('\\r\\n')\n  for i, l in enumerate(lines):\n    print(f'L{i}: |{l}|')\nelse:\n  print('Error:', json.dumps(data, indent=2)[:1000])\n\"","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779109322682,"responseId":"5d6a6787533d408983d03e38f972c865"}}
